{"id": "EUVD-2026-81752", "enisaUuid": "6bc7b62a-92fb-3b09-84dc-be81495d3f9d", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nbpf: Disallow bpf_{g,s}etsockopt() in cgroup UNIX getname hooks\n\n_bpf_setsockopt() and _bpf_getsockopt() call sock_owned_by_me() for\nfull sockets, so these helpers expect the socket lock to be held.\n\nBPF_CGROUP_UNIX_GETPEERNAME and BPF_CGROUP_UNIX_GETSOCKNAME run BPF\nprograms without acquiring the socket lock. A program attached to\neither hook can therefore trigger the sock_owned_by_me() warning by\ncalling bpf_setsockopt() or bpf_getsockopt().\n\nDisallow bpf_setsockopt() and bpf_getsockopt() for CGROUP_UNIX_GETPEERNAME\nand CGROUP_UNIX_GETSOCKNAME.", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:06:51", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:58:57", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/61769b9c882a964af3a6ebd9a8e43615f8713234", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fe91c3f64a738dd97e8542ad5bdfbe5ac430edf6", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/daeb74f5f398e847d1d42906aec6610406a34fdc", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/84473a7e1813a2da7b759ab1d098a84998c8d3f5"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-90159", "GHSA-rcrw-xvqq-c49m"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1342a04b-1fa4-3fda-9f67-44666120a449", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.7"}, {"id": "135efbe2-0ee1-358a-8161-a2dd740a2c15", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.6"}, {"id": "1464ac3a-f8bb-37aa-9918-9566999fb3d2", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "859051dd165ec6cc915f0f2114699021144fd249 <daeb74f5f398e847d1d42906aec6610406a34fdc"}, {"id": "3a2168d9-5411-3d10-ad24-38f567e54035", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "4b985f30-0203-3613-a8d2-bcb6305a77d0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.52"}, {"id": "66d9bb9f-e744-3b22-8c8f-f1663575b5f6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.110"}, {"id": "72ba4840-af84-32c2-bcec-3df9cdce94f5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "859051dd165ec6cc915f0f2114699021144fd249 <fe91c3f64a738dd97e8542ad5bdfbe5ac430edf6"}, {"id": "8f882524-7e3f-3fa7-9226-a83a7a152145", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "859051dd165ec6cc915f0f2114699021144fd249 <84473a7e1813a2da7b759ab1d098a84998c8d3f5"}, {"id": "afc62902-cfa0-3ce7-8019-6ebbce582ae9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "e950c651-2110-38c5-bab1-b39007f539be", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "859051dd165ec6cc915f0f2114699021144fd249 <61769b9c882a964af3a6ebd9a8e43615f8713234"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "864f99ec-9f61-3811-94af-d95c81c6d806", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}